        "original_id": "3659cf80-3ef5-54a6-b62c-6ec25743e297",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ricky Martin, Hank Osasuna\n- Works: Lemon La Vida Loca, Livin' la Vida Loca, Frío, Música + Alma + Sexo\n- Organizations: ITV2\n\nFacts:\n- In 1999, \"Livin' la Vida Loca\" became a number-one hit song by Puerto Rican singer Ricky Martin.\n- The show \"Lemon La Vida Loca\" takes its title from Ricky Martin's 1999 hit single \"Livin' la Vida Loca.\"\n- In 2011, \"Frío\" was released as the third single from Ricky Martin's studio album \"Música + Alma + Sexo.\"\n- Hank Osasuna later appeared as Mad Paul in ITV2's \"Lemon La Vida Loca.\"",
        "type": "TextSummary"
